Project: Age Classifier

I created a simple C program that asks the user to enter their age and classifies them into different categories:

Age 65 or above – Senior
Age 18 or above – Adult
Age 0 – Newborn
Below 18 – Child
What I Practiced
Conditional logic
Comparison operators
User input and output
Decision-making in C

Today's Progress: Practiced basic conditional statements in C and created my first age classifier program.